    "The transported quantity is X=F (g_N/g_ref)^p (r/1 kpc)^q; it is converted back to fractional excess after memory.",
    "The p=q=0 control transports fractional enhancement, p=1 q=0 transports added acceleration, and p=q=1 transports the added circular-speed-squared contribution.",
